# Rust tooling

Analogue of `python-tooling.mdc` for this craft.

## Defaults

- **`cargo fmt`** and **`cargo clippy`** clean on CI for all workspace crates
- **`cargo test`** green on at least linux (and mac for stub backends)
- Pin edition in workspace; do not mix editions without ADR
- Prefer workspace `Cargo.toml` for shared deps; deny unused public API drift
  via clippy/lints as foundation encodes

Exact Makefile/CI YAML lives in the foundation — constitution requires the
hygiene bar.

